  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell creates a burst of spores that weaken the mind. Creatures within the area must succeed at a Fortitude save or take a –1 penalty on saving throws against your enchantment spells or effects for the duration of this spell. This penalty increases to –2 for any creature that is (or could be) sexually attracted to you.",
